verify	connector-job	2026-10-07T22:18:16.6125840Z /home/runner/work/_temp/g6-cloud-build/Imported/GraphLeaves.lean:52:2: warning: Try this: 
verify	connector-job	2026-10-07T22:18:16.6126903Z   haveI̵
verify	connector-job	2026-10-07T22:18:16.6127049Z 
verify	connector-job	2026-10-07T22:18:16.6127247Z The goal is a proposition, so `have` is preferred over `haveI`.
